    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Up. No Down.\u00a0No turning back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a <strong>zero-gravity simulation</strong>, armed with only a hatchet, a chain, and a fire extinguisher. <strong>Your goal?</strong> Traverse floating debris, recover lost audio logs, and <strong>escape alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts. One wrong impulse could send you drifting into the void\u2026 <strong>forcing you to restart the level from scratch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/1f2aaaf19836025061649b7f626bd8af.poster.avif?t=1750693219\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/1f2aaaf19836025061649b7f626bd8af.webm?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/1f2aaaf19836025061649b7f626bd8af.mp4?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title combines <strong>first-person platforming</strong> with a fragmented narrative told through scattered recordings from your lost crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique physics-based mechanics</strong>: push, grab, and launch yourself in zero gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist visuals</strong> with a realistic space atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging level design:</strong> each stage tests your skill and patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling:</strong> uncover what happened to your ship and your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/89ceba1e6182ab2f71d61d58646a0b24.poster.avif?t=1750693219\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/89ceba1e6182ab2f71d61d58646a0b24.webm?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/89ceba1e6182ab2f71d61d58646a0b24.mp4?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who thrive on <strong>intense challenges</strong> and love <strong>precision mechanics</strong> and <strong>speedruns</strong>, this game pushes you to <strong>beat your own limits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; By the way\u2026 my best time is 25 minutes. <strong>Think you can beat it?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Up. No Down.\u00a0No turning back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a <strong>zero-gravity simulation</strong>, armed with only a hatchet, a chain, and a fire extinguisher. <strong>Your goal?</strong> Traverse floating debris, recover lost audio logs, and <strong>escape alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts. One wrong impulse could send you drifting into the void\u2026 <strong>forcing you to restart the level from scratch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/1f2aaaf19836025061649b7f626bd8af.poster.avif?t=1750693219\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/1f2aaaf19836025061649b7f626bd8af.webm?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/1f2aaaf19836025061649b7f626bd8af.mp4?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title combines <strong>first-person platforming</strong> with a fragmented narrative told through scattered recordings from your lost crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique physics-based mechanics</strong>: push, grab, and launch yourself in zero gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist visuals</strong> with a realistic space atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging level design:</strong> each stage tests your skill and patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling:</strong> uncover what happened to your ship and your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/89ceba1e6182ab2f71d61d58646a0b24.poster.avif?t=1750693219\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/89ceba1e6182ab2f71d61d58646a0b24.webm?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640640/extras/89ceba1e6182ab2f71d61d58646a0b24.mp4?t=1750693219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who thrive on <strong>intense challenges</strong> and love <strong>precision mechanics</strong> and <strong>speedruns</strong>, this game pushes you to <strong>beat your own limits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; By the way\u2026 my best time is 25 minutes. <strong>Think you can beat it?</strong></p>",
